# B-line IL, pre-tables (B5), part 12: one block

`blkB K Cs`: for the block starting at `st` (on `1`): scan its length `n = 1 + enF st` (`2`),
push its descriptor `encD pk b (n, am_st, ap_st)` in reading order onto the scratch stack `K`,
advance `1 += n`, count `7 += 1` (blocks) and `8 += n` (entries), and zero the work registers.
